OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FITV News' investigation comes as
OL,7,Fformer Hull funeral director Robert
OL,8,FBush is being sentenced this week
OL,9,Fafter pleading guilty to offences
OL,10,Fincluding 30 counts of preventing a
OL,11,Flawful and decent burial, ITV News'
OL,12,FJonathan Brown reports
OL,14,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,15,Fthat some people may find distressing.
OL,17,FWhen we asked how many funeral
OL,18,Fdirectors in the UK are operating
OL,19,Fwithout any oversight, nobody could
OL,20,Ftell us the answer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FIt is one of the many unknowns that
OL,7,Fexist in a sector that, despite high-
OL,8,Fprofile cases of bodies being left for
OL,9,Fweeks, or even months, decomposing in
OL,10,Funrefrigerated funeral parlours,
OL,11,Fcontinues to go unregulated.
OL,13,FOutside of Scotland, where a statutory
OL,14,Fcode of conduct was introduced for
OL,15,Ffuneral directors in March 2025, there
OL,16,Fis nothing compelling UK funeral
OL,17,Fdirectors to abide by any national
OL,18,Fstandards.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FThey currently do not have to have any
OL,7,Fspecific qualifications or even
OL,8,Ffacilities like refrigeration to
OL,9,Flegally operate in England, Wales or
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland unless they pay to
OL,11,Fbecome members of trade bodies - the
OL,12,FNational Association of Funeral
OL,13,FDirectors (NAFD) or the National
OL,14,FSociety of Allied and Independent
OL,15,FFuneral Directors (SAIF).
OL,17,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
