OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FFormer Hull funeral director Robert
OL,7,FBush was a member of neither. This
OL,8,Fweek he is being sentenced after
OL,9,Fpleading guilty to offences including
OL,10,F30 counts of preventing a lawful and
OL,11,Fdecent burial.
OL,13,FBush was in charge of Legacy
OL,14,FIndependent Funeral Directors in March
OL,15,F2024 when police recovered 35 bodies
OL,16,Fand ashes linked to more than 163
OL,17,Ffamilies from his premises.
OL,19,FBut if officers had not been tipped
OL,20,Foff by a whistleblower, he might never
OL,21,Fhave been caught.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FSimilarly, Richard Elkin and Hayley
OL,7,FBell, who ran Elkin & Bell Funeral
OL,8,FDirectors in Gosport, Hampshire, are
OL,9,Fbelieved to have deceived grieving
OL,10,Ffamilies for months.
OL,12,FBell and Elkin, who had a fake
OL,13,Fcertificate suggesting he was NAFD
OL,14,Faccredited, were not members of either
OL,15,Ftrade body and did not undergo regular
OL,16,Finspections.
OL,18,FIt was only when bailiffs raided their
OL,19,Fpremises in December 2023 that the
OL,20,Fdamp, unrefrigerated conditions they
OL,21,Fkept bodies in were uncovered.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FCorinne Boulton enlisted her childhood
OL,7,Ffriend Bell to conduct the funeral of
OL,8,Fher premature baby son Albie in June
OL,9,F2023.
OL,11,FIt later emerged in court that his
OL,12,Fbody had been "concealed" during a
OL,13,Fvisit by an Environmental Health team
OL,14,Fthe same month.
OL,16,F"It's hard enough losing somebody you
OL,17,Flove, just to find out that their body
OL,18,Fwas left to decay..." she said.
OL,26,@tD@OOUtD@YO]xD@AOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,F"I want the horrible details so mummy
OL,7,Fknows what he went through and he
OL,8,Fdoesn't do it alone but I still
OL,9,Fhaven't got those."
OL,11,FElkin and Bell were jailed for four
OL,12,Fyears in February for offences
OL,13,Fincluding prevention of a lawful and
OL,14,Fdecent burial after officers found the
OL,15,Fdecomposing body of a man whose family
OL,16,Fwere told had been cremated.
OL,18,FBut failing to prevent bodies from
OL,19,Fdecomposition does not always equate
OL,20,Fto criminal charges.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
