OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FThe family of Ron Parkin, an ex-miner
OL,7,Ffrom Clipstone in Nottinghamshire,
OL,8,Fhave found documentation suggesting
OL,9,Fhis body was incorrectly stored by his
OL,10,Ffuneral director during the height of
OL,11,Fsummer 2025 - and became "very green
OL,12,Fand bloated".
OL,14,FThe firm, which is not a member of the
OL,15,FNAFD or SAIF, told ITV News it denies
OL,16,Fany wrongdoing and insists Ron was
OL,17,Fkept in a refrigerated room - blaming
OL,18,Fhis condition on a delayed post-mortem.
OL,20,FPolice have concluded that no criminal
OL,21,Foffence was committed.
OL,26,@sD@ZOUtD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FRon's daughter Caroline said: "Just
OL,7,Fgive them (the deceased) that bit of
OL,8,Frespect in death - that's all they
OL,9,Fwant, that's all anybody can ask for
OL,10,Ffor their loved ones."
OL,12,FNot being a member of either one of
OL,13,Fthe trade bodies, in and of itself,
OL,14,Fdoes not mean a company is doing
OL,15,Fanything untoward, but it does mean
OL,16,Fthey are less likely to be held to
OL,17,Faccount if they are.
OL,26,@nD@_OUrD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
