OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FSo, in the absence of official data,
OL,7,Fwe manually checked the names of more
OL,8,Fthan 1,800 funeral directors in
OL,9,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland,
OL,10,Fwhich are listed as active by
OL,11,FCompanies House, against the NAFD and
OL,12,FSAIF databases.
OL,14,FThat revealed that more than 560 firms
OL,15,Fappear to be going unchecked.
OL,17,FWe also found that five active funeral
OL,18,Fdirectors were falsely stating online
OL,19,Fthat they were members of one or both
OL,20,Ftrade bodies.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FAndrew Judd, chief executive of the
OL,7,FNAFD, has been among those campaigning
OL,8,Ffor statutory regulation of the
OL,9,Ffuneral industry in England, Wales and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,12,FIn response to our findings, he said:
OL,13,F"I think it illustrates that there are
OL,14,Ffuneral directors operating outside of
OL,15,Foversight and scrutiny and we need to
OL,16,Fclose that gap.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,F"There is no formal register, there is
OL,7,Fno licensing regime in place, so the
OL,8,Ffact that there is no single source of
OL,9,Ftruth in terms of every funeral
OL,10,Fdirector that is operating - I think
OL,11,Fthat is a problem."
OL,13,FA SAIF spokesperson added: "While
OL,14,Fprofessional bodies can regulate their
OL,15,Fown members, only statutory regulation
OL,16,Fcan ensure every funeral director is
OL,17,Fheld to the same enforceable standards
OL,18,Fand independent oversight."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@SO]uD@\OUzD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785408478
OL,3,CITV News finds over 560 funeral
OL,4,Cdirectors appear unregulated
OL,6,FBoth the SAIF and NAFD said that where
OL,7,Frequired, businesses that we found are
OL,8,Fnot members have been asked to remove
OL,9,Ftheir insignia from their premises and
OL,10,Fwebsites.
OL,12,FThe Department of Health & Social Care
OL,13,Fsaid work is underway to drive
OL,14,Fprogress after it accepted the
OL,15,Frecommendations of the Fuller Inquiry,
OL,16,Fwhich supported the idea of statutory
OL,17,Fregulation of the funeral sector last
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
